<title>USA: Illinois direct hogs $1.50 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>Illinois direct hogs $1.50 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $1.50 lower. Demand very light. Top $56.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-2  230-260 lbs.  55.50-56.50</p>
<p>US 2-3  230-260 lbs.  54.50-55.50</p>
<p>Sows: Steady to 1.00 lower. Top 49.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-500 lbs.  42.00-45.00, few 46.00</p>
<p>	  500-600 lbs.  45.00-47.00, few 48.00</p>
<p>few over  600 lbs.  46.00-48.00, few 49.00</p>
</text>
